# Exception: the user guide is rendered at request time by core.views.user_guide
# (/help/user-guide/), so it must be in the image. Must stay the LAST rule --
# it re-includes a file excluded by both `docs/` and `*.md` above, and the last
# matching rule wins. Nothing else under docs/ enters the image.
!docs/USER_GUIDE.md
